  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/9f1f11fbb4e091305a6b414e74c3aec25b8d519670a1f3bd65f5bd4eb1bdcd68.png] \n\nGiven equation: 87 + 85 − 25 × 3 ÷ 291 = 3\n\nOption 1) ÷ and +\n\nTwo signs need to be interchanged then:\n\n⇒ __**87 ÷ 85**__ − 25 × 3 + 291 = 3\n\n⇒ 1.02 − __**25 × 3**__ + 291 = 3\n\n⇒ __**1.02**__ − 75 __**+ 291**__ = 3\n\n⇒ __**292.02**____** − 75**__ = 3\n\n⇒ 217.02 ≠ 3\n\nOption 2) + and −\n\nTwo signs need to be interchanged then:\n\n⇒ 87 - 85 + 25 × __**3 ÷ 291**__ = 3\n\n⇒ 87 - 85 + __**25 × 0.01**__ = 3\n\n⇒ __**87**__ - 85 +__** 0.25**__ = 3\n\n⇒ __**87.25 - 85**__ = 3\n\n⇒ 2.25 ≠ 3\n\n**Option 3) = and ÷**\n\nTwo signs need to be interchanged then:\n\n⇒ 87 + 85 − __**25 × 3**__ = __**291 ÷ 3**__\n\n⇒ __**87 + 85**__ − 75 = 97\n\n⇒ __**172 − 75**__ = 97\n\n​⇒ 97 = 97\n\nOption 4) − and × \n\nTwo signs need to be interchanged then:\n\n⇒ 87 + 85 × 25 - __**3 ÷ 291**__ = 3\n\n⇒ 87 + __**85 **____**×**____** 25**__ - 0.01 = 3\n\n⇒ __**87 + 21**____**25**__ - 0.01 = 3\n\n⇒ __**2212**____** - 0.01**__ = 3\n\n⇒ 2211.99 ≠ 3\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"**= and ÷**\".",
